  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 8 Enmore North and Newtown Central Precinct 8.pdf\n\nClause 9.8.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect, preserve and enhance the identified period buildings with in the precinct.\n\nClause 9.8.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect  the id entified Heritage Items  within the precinct .\n\nClause 9.8.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect, preserve and enhance other significant public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, kerb and guttering, views and vistas an d prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.8.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.8.2 - other (development_control): To protect, preserve and enhance the existing character of the streetscapes where only comp atible development is permitted.\n\nClause 9.8.2 - other (development_control): To facilitate urban renewa l in appropriate locations.\n\nClause 9.8.2 - other (land_use_zoning): To mai ntain non -retail employment as part of any mixed use redevelopment of former industrial land and  reflect  the existing industrial streetscape character in the design.\n\nClause 9.8.2 - other (development_control): To ens ure that higher density development demonstrates  good urban d esign and environmental sustai nability and provides suitable ame nity for occupants of those developments .\n\n",
